#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:8
msgid "维护或接入 OS 后端"
msgstr "Maintain or integrate an OS backend"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:10
msgid ""
"已有后端先从 TOML 选择，不为每块板复制 OSAL。新后端必须实现明确的任务、同步、 时间和生命周期合同；不能仅增加 backend "
"名字就宣称支持。"
msgstr ""
"Select an existing backend through TOML; do not copy OSAL per Board. A new "
"backend must implement explicit task, synchronization, time and lifecycle "
"contracts. Adding a backend name alone does not establish support."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:13
msgid "确定所需子集"
msgstr "Determine the required subset"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:15
msgid ""
"先列调用方实际需要的静态任务、队列、通知、等待和时间能力。未实现能力明确拒绝； ThreadX 的 Native／M4 子集不继承 FreeRTOS 的"
" tickless、隔离或端口范围。 CPU 原语、SoC 时钟与 OS 内核职责分别维护。"
msgstr ""
"First list the static task, queue, notification, wait and time capabilities "
"actually needed by callers. Reject unimplemented capabilities explicitly. "
"The Native/M4 ThreadX subset does not inherit FreeRTOS tickless, isolation "
"or port scope. Maintain CPU primitives, SoC clocks and OS kernel "
"responsibilities separately."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:19
msgid "以一条实际路径接入"
msgstr "Integrate one actual path"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:21
msgid "锁定内核、端口、许可证与编译上下文，在 `os/<backend>/` 实现窄 adapter。"
msgstr ""
"Pin the kernel, port, license and compilation context, and implement a "
"narrow adapter in `os/<backend>/`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:22
msgid "明确调用者提供的 stack、TCB、队列和控制状态，固定返回、等待、关闭与 join。"
msgstr ""
"Specify caller-provided stacks, TCBs, queues and control state, and define "
"return, wait, close and join behavior."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:23
msgid "实现同一绝对单调 deadline 和最终谓词观察，拒绝非法 ISR 调用和优先级。"
msgstr ""
"Implement the same absolute monotonic deadline and final predicate "
"observation; reject invalid ISR calls and priorities."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:24
msgid "验证真实任务执行、部分创建失败、通知竞争、超时、关闭和失败排空。"
msgstr ""
"Validate actual task execution, partial-creation failures, notification "
"races, timeouts, close and failed drain."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:25
msgid "编译所维护的 CPU／ABI 组合，再单独记录 MCU 上下文、栈峰值和时序实测。"
msgstr ""
"Compile maintained CPU/ABI combinations, then separately record MCU context,"
" stack peaks and measured timing."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:27
msgid ""
"应用拥有 scheduler 启动和产品 worker。Platform start 不进入内核；任务入口返回 或通知到达不授权回收 "
"stack／TCB。内核仍使用的 Tick、时钟和 IRQ 必须保留。"
msgstr ""
"The application owns scheduler startup and product workers. Platform start "
"does not enter the kernel. Task-entry return or notification arrival does "
"not authorize stack/TCB reclamation. Tick, clock and IRQ infrastructure "
"still used by the kernel must be retained."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:30
msgid "与配置和构建组合"
msgstr "Compose with configuration and builds"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:32
msgid ""
"后端的能力与策略字段进入公开合同和 typed IR，实际 CMake 目标发布为所选 "
"`Nexus::OS`。新增后端同时维护兼容性事实、依赖选择、生成、Source SDK profile 和实际消费者，不创建第二套实例或源码图。"
msgstr ""
"Backend capability and policy fields enter public contracts and typed IR. "
"The selected actual CMake target is published as `Nexus::OS`. A new backend "
"also maintains compatibility facts, dependency selection, generation, Source"
" SDK profiles and real consumers. Do not create another instance or source "
"graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:36
msgid ""
"详细 port、IRQ ceiling、Tick 和错误语义集中在 "
"[后端集成合同](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md)。应用停机见 [OS 停止](os-"
"shutdown.md)，生产变更按[开发流程](../development/workflow.md)执行。"
msgstr ""
"Detailed port, IRQ-ceiling, Tick and error semantics are centralized in the "
"[backend integration contract](../reference/contracts/os/backend-"
"integration.md). See [OS shutdown](os-shutdown.md) for application shutdown "
"and follow the [development workflow](../development/workflow.md) for "
"production changes."
